1

00:00:06,603 --> 00:00:08,336

[Episode 11]


2

00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:15,170

Why are you...


3

00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:20,070

Halt!


4

00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:23,436

Identify yourselves.


5

00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:28,403

Unhand her.


6

00:00:31,236 --> 00:00:32,570

I said unhand her.


7

00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:35,236

My Lord.


8

00:00:36,136 --> 00:00:40,103

Are you deaf?

Unhand her now!


9

00:00:41,636 --> 00:00:43,303

Get them!


10

00:01:03,303 --> 00:01:07,503

Back away or I'll cut her.


11

00:01:08,536 --> 00:01:13,270

- My Lord.

- Stop this or we'll stop you.


12

00:01:13,270 --> 00:01:15,136

Now!


13

00:01:36,570 --> 00:01:39,570

- Are you alright?

- My Lord.


14

00:01:39,636 --> 00:01:44,070

What are you doing here

at this time of night?


15

00:01:53,603 --> 00:01:55,470

Your orders, Sir?


16

00:01:55,562 --> 00:02:02,526

They look like common criminals.

Hand them over to the local police.


17

00:02:02,636 --> 00:02:04,489

Sir.


18

00:02:14,136 --> 00:02:15,753

The King's not in the palace?


19

00:02:15,936 --> 00:02:20,399

No. He was looking for you

at the Police Bureau.


20

00:02:22,070 --> 00:02:23,370

What?


21

00:02:23,370 --> 00:02:26,336

Well? What were you doing here?


22

00:02:27,170 --> 00:02:30,203

Thank you, My Lord.

You saved my life.


23

00:02:30,270 --> 00:02:33,103

What have I told you?

Go out early.


24

00:02:33,203 --> 00:02:36,670

If I hadn't come by,

who knows what might have happened.


25

00:02:37,136 --> 00:02:42,570

I'm sorry, My Lord,

but this was especially important.


26

00:02:44,270 --> 00:02:45,536

Especially?


27

00:02:45,570 --> 00:02:49,403

I was looking for you, actually.


28

00:02:50,070 --> 00:02:52,103

For me?


29

00:02:52,270 --> 00:02:53,436

For me? Why?


30

00:02:53,470 --> 00:02:57,470

I had to tell you something.

I went to the administrative offices.


31

00:02:57,470 --> 00:02:59,270

You what?


32

00:03:00,036 --> 00:03:06,136

But the guard said

you'd never heard of me.


33

00:03:08,270 --> 00:03:13,603

Why'd you say that, though?


34

00:03:15,136 --> 00:03:18,336

I'm not sure...


35

00:03:18,403 --> 00:03:23,170

Wait! The guard went to Officer Kang,

of course. That's it.


36

00:03:23,170 --> 00:03:24,636

Huh?


37

00:03:24,636 --> 00:03:27,470

There are two inspectors in our office.

Kang's the other one.


38

00:03:27,603 --> 00:03:32,370

- Ah, so that's it?

- Of course. I'd never say that.


39

00:03:32,403 --> 00:03:37,403

Ah, I see. I thought maybe

you'd forgotten me.


40

00:03:38,670 --> 00:03:43,170

So what was so important that

you had to come find me?


41

00:03:44,203 --> 00:03:46,136

Well, it's this way...


42

00:03:52,470 --> 00:03:55,636

What?

The King saved her?


43

00:03:55,636 --> 00:04:01,270

Yes, Sir. The royal guard turned

them over to the local police.


44

00:04:07,336 --> 00:04:12,703

Luckily they're being tried as

common criminals. We're safe on that score.


45

00:04:14,403 --> 00:04:23,570

But what went wrong? The King saving

a servant? Why would he do that?


46

00:04:32,670 --> 00:04:34,170

Sire.


47

00:04:35,303 --> 00:04:36,670

Sire.


48

00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:42,636

I spoke with the girl on the way here.


49

00:04:43,203 --> 00:04:46,236

Do we really have information

that clears Lady Jang?


50

00:04:47,203 --> 00:04:49,170

Yes, Sire.


51

00:04:50,236 --> 00:04:53,370

Where's the body?

I need to see it.


52

00:04:53,436 --> 00:04:55,270

Sire.


53

00:05:19,570 --> 00:05:22,370

- Show His Highness.

- Sir.


54

00:05:26,503 --> 00:05:30,436

- Now with some pinellia on your hands.

- Sir.


55

00:05:52,103 --> 00:05:55,403

But... How could...


56

00:05:56,570 --> 00:06:02,636

Contact with pinellia would have

discolored the doctor's hands.


57

00:06:03,636 --> 00:06:05,670

That's what happened, Sire.


58

00:06:06,170 --> 00:06:12,136

This proves the pharmacist

didn't send pinellia to Lady Jang.


59

00:06:16,503 --> 00:06:21,270

And Dongyi discovered this?


60

00:06:21,336 --> 00:06:23,703

Yes, Sire.


